  - computational social science
  - natural language processing
  - ideology
abstract: >-
  Pipeline and models that break a text down into three strata (Record, Enunciation,
  Mediation) following Maurizio Ferraris's New Realism, typing entities as physical,
  ideal or social and labelling each claim with a hermeneutic operator (naturalised,
  revealed, other) together with the ground the clause makes a founding act rest on. Campaign 1
  corpus: the preambles of in-force constitutions (English and Spanish records); an exploratory
  study on emergency provisions preceded it.
